<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Who Actually Uses What — America's Social Media Divide</title>
  <meta name="description" content="A data-driven visual essay exploring how social media platform usage splits sharply across age groups in America, using Pew Research 2023 data." />

  <!-- Bootstrap 5 -->
