  <header>
    <div class="hero">
      <span class="kicker">A Visual Essay on Platform Usage in America</span>
      <h1>Who Actually Uses <em>What</em></h1>
      <p class="deck">
        Everyone thinks they know social media. But the platforms different generations
        actually rely on tell a more fractured story — one that reveals not just taste,
        but entirely separate digital worlds.
      </p>
      <p class="byline">
        Data: <span>Pew Research Center, Social Media Use in 2023</span>
        &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; Visualization: Charts using Chart.js
